&_nc_oc=AdriWHzrwo6mn5ss2NKBt_d86dNlOdGaJlIv5YpEXpQHn7Tzno1JKB3aOSRLupwYsTA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1s0_f4LQn-cg6bbyLGvwa26ybIn9XZqQYWdEfyKhcJ4w&oe=69F4C3BE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WXFTUFA3xuMQ7kNvwG89Duu&_nc_oc=AdoP6SYzRdXpk5r-Xvm1SsnRpifkhhqLRqC0oJpOdmM-noZ7IEvTG1B21D0W1rpgeVU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1webgptZlgYgYJAOevNE4QW0lQ3l5IzKy-4U0CtNfcwQ&oe=69F49C7C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Civ0aE6Rj9MQ7kNvwFv9Psd&_nc_oc=AdrniZXW6yuBM7cgjm6pR5yvK6-w5x-kENBsQM7P5vMhGN8dCxOKpkNJ6QjIH0II5YA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3Kd7VbBCmZN0UVBremGRpdqYnJgKd_9uEgqR9PBDMUUA&oe=69F4BB07"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hcu8z3Je24cQ7kNvwH0KnVM&_nc_oc=AdoLebpa3oVSNR-Fd7Idw5G-PJIwKa6giU86ii4E_nXxnoBArHxXOEbnrB3Nh-RRzs4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1bqVJnFaveyHzN8rEjniu8bOrNLJkNRxdj_C0n8kmEGQ&oe=69F4A6D5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ccog-3B5408Q7kNvwESTVcr&_nc_oc=AdqToHTy1w5WQ2K1J-nB7ToIfxs2jhyOlWJ2mgp2pVdXylQD3ZnEwEdu0D8wQ_0bZsU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af38ZjCM72DqLTrng1244szh7D58nLxmbh4_Xxh8V2rIRw&oe=69F4B364"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.